        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "116. It is agreed that the Employer and the Union shall maintain descriptions setting forth job duties in accordance with duties necessary and traditional in the operation of hospitals concerned with the care, treatment, and recovery of patients. At the time an employee commences work or is assigned a new position, he/she will be provided with a job description outlining the duties and assignments of that position as an aid to understanding the requirements of the new job. A copy will be sent to the Union. When new jobs are created and mutually agreed to be within the jurisdiction of this bargaining agreement, the Employer shall notify the Union of the wage rate and attach a copy of the new job description. Any disagreements may be resolved under the provisions of this Section.",
            "block_bbox": [
                144,
                824,
                1082,
                1130
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 8,
