        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "117. It is recognized that changes in job titles contained in this Agreement may be necessary in accomplishing this project and such changes shall be by mutual agreement under the terms of this Agreement. Job descriptions shall be made available to the Union upon request.",
